s from examples, reinforcement learning in Markov Decision Processes, perceptron learning, and deep learning. We touch briefly on the future of AI.     The teaching methodology combines lectures, in-class and out-of-class exercises, and programming assignments.","topics":[],"score":227591,"global_rank":117450,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":20309},{"name":"sarah926/VM-creation","owner":"sarah926","html_url":"https://github.com/sarah926/VM-creation","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Creates VMs in GCP and Azure using config files to specify parameters.","topics":[],"score":227587,"global_rank":117460,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":20310},{"name":"sarah926/AWS-shell","owner":"sarah926","html_url":"https://github.com/sarah926/AWS-shell","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Created a shell that allows users to run processes connected with AWS.","topics":[],"score":227587,"global_rank":117461,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":20311},{"name":"hanklokyaw/Prefer_Stock_Level_Dashboard","owner":"hanklokyaw","html_url":"https://github.com/hanklokyaw/Prefer_Stock_Level_Dashboard","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"This is a dashboard which take Inventory On Hand Quantity, On Order Quantity, Preferred Stock Level, Reorder Point from a data frame and visualize in bar plot.","topics":[],"score":227587,"global_rank":117465,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":20312},{"name":"Neeraj224/Text-Editor","owner":"Neeraj224","html_url":"https://github.com/Neeraj224/Text-Editor","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A simple text editor with basic functionalities made in Python","topics":[],"score":227587,"global_rank":117474,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":20313},{"name":"jgansl/financial-mathmatics","owner":"jgansl","html_url":"https://github.com/jgans